#: ../../source/docs/common-spracingh7-rf.rst:77
#: 0ffe14f0e6d346f4a352cc42f8563675
msgid ""
"RC input is configured on the R2 pin. It supports all serial RC protocols. "
"PPM is not supoorted. For protocols requiring half-duplex serial to transmit"
" telemetry (such as FPort) you should setup SERIAL2 as an RC input serial "
"port, with half-duplex, pin-swap and inversion enabled. For duplex "
"protocols, like CRSF/ELRS, T2 must also be connected to the receiver."
msgstr ""
"RC 输入配置在 R2 引脚上。支持所有串行 RC 协议，不支持 PPM。对于需要半双工串行以发送数传数传的协议（如 FPort），应将 SERIAL2"
" 配置为启用半双工、引脚交换和反相功能的 RC 输入串口。对于双工协议（如 CRSF/ELRS），T2 也需连接到接收机。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spracingh7-rf.rst:82
#: 2a3b357998c34924bced6279df57b692 2e7c1360e88441689ada006eadb1f125
