#: 7f8c92d1be9046b69bfbdfb81642edbd aefca06124a246b9ab3459dfe165e901
msgid ""
"The SPRacingH7 RF supports up to 9 PWM outputs. PWM 1-8 support DShot and "
"Bi-Directional DShot. The pads for motor output M1 to M4 on ESC connector 1,"
" and M5 to M8 on ESC connector 2, plus M9 for LED strip or another PWM "
"output."
msgstr ""
"SPRacingH7 RF 最多支持 9 路 PWM 输出。PWM 1–8 支持 DShot 和双向 DShot。ESC 连接器1上的 M1 至 "
"M4，ESC 连接器2上的 M5 至 M8，以及 M9 用于 LED 灯带或其他 PWM 输出。"

